i benda bersuhu rendah kebenda beruhu tunggi","The Molecules of an object move faster when ist temperature rises"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyMzg"},{"id":"MjQ2-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Diagram Mana menunjukkan lintasan yang benar dari cahaya melewati prisma ?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200907094833.PNG\" style=\"height:89px; width:467px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyMzk"},{"id":"MjQ2-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>The thermometers below show the temperature of a liquid at the beginning and at the end of an experiment.</p><p>How did the temperature of the liquid change from the beginning to the end of the experiment ?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200907095643.PNG\" style=\"height:210px; width:156px\" /></p>","choices":["It went down&nbsp;<img alt=\"4^oF\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?4%5EoF\" />","It wen down&nbsp;<img alt=\"8^oF\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?8%5EoF\" />","it went up&nbsp;<img alt=\"2^oF\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?2%5EoF\" />","it went up&nbsp;<img alt=\"10^oF\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?10%5EoF\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTAyNDA"}]
